'''Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes''' (逆襲の英雄ダークヒーローズ, ''?'', '''?''') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats. This event was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou]] on July 13th, 2015. All Uber Rares in this set have a different use with each form and are all [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]].

To unlock this banner in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], to player needs to clear [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]] in the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') and '''International''' ('''WW''') versions and [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] in the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version .

