==Trivia==
*Like the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]], all members in this event have different usages in any form. Their trait targeting and abilities may change throughout evolution. However, every Dark Heroes member targets Aliens in at least one form.
*Most members of this event have unchanged stats between their normal and evolved/true forms, with only two exceptions. Detective Vigler has a faster attack animation in his True Form, and Warlock and Pierre gain health and attack power in their True Form.
*The tagline for Dark Merchant Babil on the English poster, reading "Collecting wicked souls is their business... and business is GOOD!", may be a reference to the 1985 thrash metal album [[wikipedia:Killing Is My Business... and Business Is Good!|Killing Is My Business... and Business is Good!]].
*All Ubers in this set have the Dark Heroes logo somewhere on their Normal and Evolved Form designs, though none have it in True Form or Ultra Form.
**[[Akira (Uber Rare Cat)|Akira]] and Shadow Akira have it on their left shoulder.
**[[Mekako Saionji (Uber Rare Cat)|Mekako Saionji]] has it across the mech's chest and Dr. Mekako has it near the upper left of the mech's chest.
**[[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Catman]] and Dark Catman have it on their belts, though this is only visible during their idle and attack animations.
**[[The White Rabbit (Uber Rare Cat)|The White Rabbit]] and The Black Cat also have it on their belts.
**[[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Warlock and Pierre]] have it on the sorcerer's chest and Dark Merchant Babil has it on the sorcerer's hood.
**[[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Detective Vigler]] and Inspector Gabriel have it on their lanyards.
**[[Sharpshooter Saki (Uber Rare Cat)|Sharpshooter Saki]] and Nighthunter Saki have it on their rifles.
**[[White Knight Cyclops (Uber Rare Cat)|White Knight Cyclops]] and Black Knight Kyklops have it on their guns.
**[[Thunder Jack (Uber Rare Cat)|Thunder Jack]] and Bloody Jack have it on their belts.
**[[Mech Patrol Axel (Uber Rare Cat)|Mech Patrol Axel]] and Steel Sergeant Axel have it on their left shoulders.
**[[Type-Monshiro (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Type-Monshiro]] and Type-Swallow Tail have it on their chests.
**[[Doktor Heaven (Legend Rare Cat)|Doktor Heaven]] and Professor Abyss have it across the top of their tanks.
**This also applies to Seasonal variants of the Ubers in this set, though all of them except [[Squirtgun Saki (Uber Rare Cat)|Squirtgun Saki]] also have the logo in their True Form.

